{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415763","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415763","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041576301:1":{"text":"실피라, 나의 연회 초대는 거절하더니, 멀린과는 함께 있었던 모양이군.","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯，你拒绝了我的宴会邀请，却出现在了梅林这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C42CB2C628E57F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576302:1":{"text":"설마 내 연회보다 멀린의 거처에서 보내는 시간이 더 좋아진 건가?","source_cn":"难道说，相比于我的宴会，你现在更喜欢在梅林的居所消磨时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x720BBB0BDB18C50E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576303:1":{"text":"너무 그러지 말아요. 저도 가끔은 새로운 곳에서 조용히 있고 싶답니다.","source_cn":"别这么说，偶尔也让我换个地方清净一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D57B8130871C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576304:1":{"text":"당신 연회에 가면, 또 저를 곤란하게 만드시겠죠?","source_cn":"我只要一去你的宴会，不免又会被你怂恿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x574975B5EA79786D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576305:1":{"text":"결국 전 연회 내내 쉴 틈 없이 연주나 해야 할 테고, 당신만 느긋하게 즐기겠지요.","source_cn":"结果就是，整场宴会中我一直在不停歇地演奏，你反而成了最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2185BE358DC58934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576306:1":{"text":"내 손님들이 전부 네 음악에 흠뻑 빠져버린 걸 어쩌겠어? 게다가, 나보다 내 하프의 선율을 가장 잘 이끌어내는 건 너잖아?","source_cn":"谁让我的客人都着迷于你的音乐呢？你可比我都更熟悉我的竖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3430959A583A5C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576307:1":{"text":"그리고 내내 혼자서 외롭기만 했던 건 아니잖아? 일리아랑 라이라가 네 연주에 맞춰 춤을 췄을 텐데?","source_cn":"再说，你也不是孤零零的一个人吧，伊莱亚和莱拉不是为你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E5DF636946AA4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576308:1":{"text":"호흡이 잘 맞는 공연이긴 했어요. 다만 그 훌륭한 호흡이 저를 제외한 그 두 사람만의 것이었다는 게 흠이지만요.","source_cn":"很有默契的演出，只不过这默契只属于他们两人之间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9001E5243F48A7B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576309:1":{"text":"스텝이 정확히 반 박자씩 느렸거든요.","source_cn":"他们踏出的每一步舞步都比它应该踏出的时间要刚好慢半拍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C6823F52DBED7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576310:1":{"text":"하하, 뒤로 갈수록 박자가 좀 꼬이긴 했지만, 너희 공연은 충분히 훌륭했어. 다들 아주 넋을 잃고 빠져들었더군!","source_cn":"哈哈，虽然跳到后面节拍是乱了，却无损于你们演出的精彩。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DF110FC99C9BD25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576311:1":{"text":"확실한가요? 전 분명 아탈리아가 “심판”이라고 하는 걸 들었는데요.","source_cn":"你确定吗？我听到阿塔利娅提起了裁决二字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15694295FB774A8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576312:1":{"text":"하하하... 그건 그냥 습관이잖아. 흥분하면 그런 말을 하는 편이니까.","source_cn":"哈哈哈……那只不过是她的习惯而已，她一激动就喜欢说这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1E412DB9B9F84E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576313:1":{"text":"이러면 어떨까? 다음에는 바엘란도 부르지.","source_cn":"不如这样吧，下次我把巴赫朗叫上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA41781FC8206417","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576314:1":{"text":"얼마 전에 오래된 민간 악보 뭉치를 얻었다고 하더군? 허나 그 연주법의 맥이 끊긴 지 오래라, 그저 진흙 속 진주 꼴이 되었다지 뭔가.","source_cn":"他不久前提起过，他搜集了一批古老的民间乐谱，可惜那种弹...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D67D119F67D322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576315:1":{"text":"탈렌도 초대해야겠어. 네 아름다운 음악을 들으면 기분이 좋아져서 화음을 더해 줄지도 모르지.","source_cn":"再请塔琳过来，听到你那优美的乐声，或许心情大好的她也会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB3BED95EA5092A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576316:1":{"text":"그건... 괜찮겠네요.","source_cn":"听起来……还不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8C0BF0E62210055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576317:1":{"text":"당연하지! 내 연회는 에스페리아에서 가장 멋진 연회니까!","source_cn":"当然不错！我的宴会绝对是伊索米亚最精彩的宴会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9407DE0D1024A281","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576318:1":{"text":"그리고 이 연회에 네가 빠지면 안 돼.","source_cn":"这宴会，可不能少了你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA3660BA7816F5E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"샤키탈리스","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奥菲戈斯":{"text":"실피라","source":"奥菲戈斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}